1. OpenDRT (display render transform, Plan M2-6 phase)

   Upstream: jedypod/open-display-transform v1.1.0
   https://github.com/jedypod/open-display-transform
   License: GPLv3 (c) Jed Smith

   Lightamer's Display Transform (OpenDRT method) is an INDEPENDENT
   implementation: the algorithm structure was studied from the upstream
   DCTL (read-only reference) and re-written from the math in Swift and
   Metal Shading Language. No upstream code or text is copied into this
   repository. The preset parameter value tables (Look/Tonescale/Creative
   White) are transcribed NUMERIC FACTS (parameter values that select
   behaviors of the algorithm); they are data, not expressive content, and
   are recorded here with attribution per that boundary. The reference
   implementation files are:

